  "rationale": "The batch repeatedly places nouns after adjectives, but several noun roots have little or no matching evidence for that context; this makes observed continuations such as “The small pears/needles” poorly supported. A reusable suffix rule increases noun evidence after an adjective for the recurring objects and village noun, while a determiner-specific rule addresses “The needles.” The repeated “And that” closing is also weakly supported by the lowercase that root, so add a narrow lexical-context rule. These changes do not make other continuations impossible. Adjective+noun sequences can take many nouns, and “that” can occur in other contexts, so the rules provide evidence rather than exclusivity. The proposed patch has not passed the replay gate.",
